240x240.jpg", "samples": ["https://img.dlsite.jp/modpub/images2/work/doujin/RJ01733000/RJ01732912_img_smp1.jpg", "https://img.dlsite.jp/modpub/images2/work/doujin/RJ01733000/RJ01732912_img_smp2.jpg"], "sample_thumbs": ["https://img.dlsite.jp/resize/images2/work/doujin/RJ01733000/RJ01732912_img_smp1_100x100.jpg", "https://img.dlsite.jp/resize/images2/work/doujin/RJ01733000/RJ01732912_img_smp2_100x100.jpg"], "alt": "ケイちゃんの野外露出 [ふしだら教室]"}, "introductions": [{"type": "text", "title": "ケイちゃんの野外露出チャレンジ！", "body": [{"intro": "人が通るかもしれないドキドキを感じて、野外露出するケイちゃん。<br />\r\n誰か来ると思ったら上着を着てやり過ごそう。<br />\r\n日和りすぎて誰も通らないのに上着を着てばかりいるとつまらないので、大胆さも大事。<br />\r\n2分の1を当て続けるゲームです。8回露出できたらゲームクリア、人が来てない時に上着を着ているのを5回繰り返すか裸を人に見られるとゲームオーバー。<br />\r\n通常モードでのクリアはかなりの運ゲー。<br />\r\n絶対に人が来ない無敵モードあり。"}]}, {"type": "text", "title": "Kei-chan Naked Outdoors", "body": [{"intro": "Feeling that heart-pounding excitement at the thought that someone might walk by, Kei-chan gets naked outside.<br />\r\nIf she thinks someone’s coming, she’ll just put on her jacket and wait it out.<br />\r\nIt’s too boring to keep putting on her jacket when it’s such a nice day and no one’s around, so being bold is important.<br />\r\nThis is a game where you keep guessing whether it’s “half or half.” You clear the game if you can flash 8 times; it’s game over if you put on your jacket 5 times when no one’s around or if someone sees you naked.<br />\r\nClearing the game in Normal Mode is pretty much a game of chance.<br />\r\nThere’s also an Invincible Mode where no one ever comes by."}]}], "description": "ケイちゃんの野外露出チャレンジ！", "short_introduction": "ケイちゃんの野外露出チャレンジ！", "url": "https://www.dlsite.com/maniax/work/=/product_id/RJ01732912.html", "site_id": "maniax", "fetched_at": 1794942251}